{"type":"message","id":"a3cf1c61","parentId":"91df96f6","timestamp":"2026-05-27T08:14:48.340Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_bdrk_014LZuAJBQJkS5zw7GqqBbfc","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"crates/skillet/src/budget.rs:        make_skill(tmp.path(), \"gamma\", \"uses a fragment\", \"{{> note }}\\n\");\ncrates/skillet/src/check.rs:            \"---\\nname: my-skill\\ndescription: \\\"test\\\"\\n---\\n\\n{{> note }}\\n\",\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:    LazyLock::new(|| Regex::new(r\"^\\{\\{>\\s*([\\w-]+)\\s*\\}\\}\\s*$\").unwrap());\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:/// Expands `{{> fragment-name }}` include directives in `body`.\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:        let body = \"intro\\n{{> note }}\\noutro\\n\";\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:        let body = \"{{> missing }}\\n\";\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:        frags.insert(\"outer\".to_string(), \"## Outer\\n{{> inner }}\\n\".to_string());\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:        let body = \"{{> outer }}\\n\";\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:        let body = \"{{> safe }}\\n\";\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:                content: \"---\\nname: my-skill\\ndescription: \\\"\\\"\\n---\\n\\n{{> note }}\\n\".to_string(),\ncrates/skillet/src/compile.rs:        assert!(!result.output.contains(\"{{> note }}\"));\ncrates/skillet/src/lint/mod.rs:            \"---\\nname: diagnose\\ndescription: x\\n---\\n\\n{{> note }}\\n\",\ncrates/skillet/src/lint/rules/unused_fragment.rs:static FRAGMENT_INCLUDE_RE: LazyLock<Regex> =\ncrates/skillet/src/lint/rules/unused_fragment.rs:    LazyLock::new(|| Regex::new(r\"(?m)^\\{\\{>\\s*([\\w-]+)\\s*\\}\\}\").unwrap());\ncrates/skillet/src/lint/rules/unused_fragment.rs:        for caps in FRAGMENT_INCLUDE_RE.captures_iter(&sf.raw) {\ncrates/skillet-cli/tests/build_tests.rs:fn build_expands_fragment_includes_in_output() {\ncrates/skillet-cli/tests/build_tests.rs:    source.push_str(\"\\n{{> note }}\\n\");\ncrates/skillet-cli/tests/build_test