{"type":"message","id":"c6dc8cdd","parentId":"0ca60b6d","timestamp":"2026-05-27T08:15:53.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All checks pass. The implementation was already complete in the worktree. Here's a summary of what's in place:\n\n**Already implemented (found in worktree):**\n\n1. **`crates/skillet-compiler/src/lex.rs`** — `var::` and `env::` ref kinds (`RefVar`, `RefEnv`) are recognized as tokens.\n\n2. **`crates/skillet-compiler/src/parse.rs`** — `RefKind::Var`/`RefKind::Env` are emitted as `Node::Ref` variants; tests for `var_ref_produces_ref_node_with_var_kind` and `env_ref_produces_ref_node_with_env_kind` exist.\n\n3. **`crates/skillet-compiler/src/lib.rs`** — `pub mod parse` exposes the parser publicly.\n\n4. **`crates/skillet/Cargo.toml`** — `skillet-compiler = { path = \"../skillet-compiler\" }` dependency is wired.\n\n5. **`crates/skillet/src/refs.rs`** — `ParsedRefs::extract` uses `PanSource::new` + `PanParse::new` + `parse()`, maps parser ref kinds to lint `RefKind`, handles `RefSuspect` via `classify_untyped`, keeps markdown links regex-based. All 7 focused regression tests pass.\n\n**All acceptance criteria pass:** fmt ✓, clippy ✓, build ✓, compiler-parser-tests ✓, parsed-refs-tests (7/7) ✓, phase2-pipeline-regression ✓, lint-stale-ref-regressions (7/7) ✓, markdown-link-regressions ✓, skillet crate tests (145/145) ✓."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","usage":{"input":1,"output":440,"cacheRead":34258,"cacheWrite":358,"totalTokens":35057,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779869741710,"responseId":"msg_bdrk_01Kx1U6HSux5iGoDHj73KeHR"}}
